{"name": "Dynamite Dashers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/ce24d86c6ee1913a7b6dfcfee7b06dd2.poster.avif?t=1780654685\" width=\"950\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/ce24d86c6ee1913a7b6dfcfee7b06dd2.webm?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/ce24d86c6ee1913a7b6dfcfee7b06dd2.mp4?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamite Dashers is a fast-paced 2D top-down bomber roguelike</strong> where you play as an explosives expert dwarf blasting everything in his path to get treasure so his village doesn't starve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stick charges to your enemies while dodging projectiles, then blast them into bits at the press of a button. Find treasures hidden within the mine walls and your enemies\u2019 guts to grow stronger after every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/8afab65cd68d63f96b87588d5d19cb09.poster.avif?t=1780654685\" width=\"390\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/8afab65cd68d63f96b87588d5d19cb09.webm?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/8afab65cd68d63f96b87588d5d19cb09.mp4?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"534\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/5143595db0d08b048cd16498a3446d79.poster.avif?t=1780654685\" width=\"950\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/5143595db0d08b048cd16498a3446d79.webm?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/5143595db0d08b048cd16498a3446d79.mp4?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A New Run, A New Build To Try</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go the more vicious your enemies get, but so do your bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gain power-ups</strong> as you delve deeper into the mines to blast your enemies to oblivion in a variety of ways, creating your own arsenal build as you go deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment with wild builds</strong> using a variety of power-ups, from massive explosions and projectile bursts to autonomous drones that fight for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/52d0bd9aa46eeeb7ed41a6c02a322a23.poster.avif?t=1780654685\" width=\"390\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/52d0bd9aa46eeeb7ed41a6c02a322a23.webm?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/52d0bd9aa46eeeb7ed41a6c02a322a23.mp4?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"534\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/77996261a31c0555c6a5fe0dca63200c.poster.avif?t=1780654685\" width=\"952\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/77996261a31c0555c6a5fe0dca63200c.webm?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/77996261a31c0555c6a5fe0dca63200c.mp4?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Kills You <i>Makes </i>You Stronger! </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress beyond each run</strong> with persistent passive upgrades that permanently boost your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock powerful passives</strong> that enhance movement, damage, and introduce unique effects inspired by game-changing power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong> Nitro Gems during every run, looted from defeated enemies and destructible environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/2259f94bd3896a81b44c5c3cd1b9b87d.poster.avif?t=1780654685\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/2259f94bd3896a81b44c5c3cd1b9b87d.webm?t=1780654685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced</strong> gameplay where every run is different combining the use of tactical bomb-sticking, explosions and <strong>bullet-hell</strong> gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural</strong> levels mixed with tactical bomb placement and bullet-hell action keep every run fresh and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go from a <strong>firecracker</strong> to a <strong>nuke</strong> with a combination of <strong>power-ups</strong> and <strong>passives</strong> and blast the terrain to kingdom come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get persistent upgrades</strong> with the gems found through your runs to get stronger as you unlock nodes in the passive tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> the mines and uncover the uncanny biomes that lie within the depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerful bosses</strong> to see if you\u2019re worthy of the deepest treasures of the mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full gamepad support</strong>, so you can blast <i>any way you want, just the way you need it!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What treasure lies at the deepest reaches of the mine? And moreover, who or what could be guarding it?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Throw bombs, upgrade your skills, and survive endless waves of enemies in this fast-paced roguelike action game. Build your explosive arsenal, discover powerful combos, and see how long you can stay alive!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/8b55d6a4cdd06d7283afb02a656b135ce4a184e0/header.jpg?t=1780654685", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Action Roguelike", "Shooter", "Arcade", "Runner", "Bullet Hell"], "developers": "Night Steed Games", "publishers": "Night Steed Games", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", 